WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.169 --> 00:00:04.238
EVEN WITH SOME OF THE GOOD STUFF

00:00:02.804 --> 00:00:08.142
THAT IS IN THIS BILL.

00:00:04.372 --> 00:00:10.812
AND THAT'S THE ANGLE.

00:00:08.276 --> 00:00:12.547
JOINING ME NOW FOR REACTION IS

00:00:10.945 --> 00:00:15.416
REPUBLICAN CONGRESSMAN MARK

00:00:12.680 --> 00:00:18.853
IMMEDIATE OS CHAIRMAN OF THE

00:00:15.550 --> 00:00:20.688
HOUSE FREEDOM CAUCUS, AND A

00:00:18.986 --> 00:00:22.557
DEMOCRAT FROM ILLINOIS, GREAT TO

00:00:20.822 --> 00:00:24.826
SEE BOTH YOU.

00:00:22.690 --> 00:00:26.394
LET'S START WITH YOU,

00:00:24.959 --> 00:00:28.696
CONGRESSMAN MEADOWS.

00:00:26.527 --> 00:00:30.298
I DELIVERED SOME TOUGH MEDICINE,

00:00:28.830 --> 00:00:33.601
BUT THAT'S WHAT I'M GOING TO DO.

00:00:30.431 --> 00:00:35.436
WHEN I LOOK AT THIS LEGISLATION,

00:00:33.735 --> 00:00:37.905
I CALL IT LEGISLATION, BUT IT'S

00:00:35.570 --> 00:00:42.176
MORE THAN -- THERE IT IS.

00:00:38.039 --> 00:00:42.710
I THINK THIS IS NOT DRAINING THE

00:00:42.310 --> 00:00:44.545
SWAMP.

00:00:42.844 --> 00:00:44.946
WHO'S ACTUALLY READING THIS,

00:00:44.679 --> 00:00:46.881
CONGRESSMAN?

00:00:45.079 --> 00:00:47.215
WHO HAS READ THIS ENTIRE BILL

00:00:47.014 --> 00:00:49.417
TONIGHT?

00:00:47.348 --> 00:00:52.386
&gt;&gt; I CAN TELL YOU, NO ONE'S READ

00:00:49.550 --> 00:00:54.355
THE ENTIRE BILL, SOME 2,230

00:00:52.520 --> 00:00:55.323
PAGES THAT WE GOT OVER A LITTLE

00:00:54.489 --> 00:00:57.258
OVER AN HOUR AGO.

00:00:55.456 --> 00:00:58.259
I'M ABOUT 200 PAGES INTO IT.

00:00:57.391 --> 00:00:58.860
OBVIOUSLY WE HAVE STAFF GOING

00:00:58.392 --> 00:01:00.595
THROUGH IT.

00:00:58.993 --> 00:01:01.729
BUT REALLY, THIS IS NOT ABOUT

00:01:00.728 --> 00:01:03.898
DRAINING THE SWAMP.

00:01:01.863 --> 00:01:05.833
WHEN YOU LOOK AT THIS PARTICULAR

00:01:04.031 --> 00:01:07.468
BILL, WERE YOU TOO HARSH?

00:01:05.967 --> 00:01:08.936
THE ANSWER IS, NO, YOU COULD BE

00:01:07.602 --> 00:01:10.872
A LOT HARSHER.

00:01:09.070 --> 00:01:11.439
WE CONTINUE TO FUND SANCTUARY

00:01:11.005 --> 00:01:14.909
CITIES.

00:01:11.572 --> 00:01:15.309
WE CONTINUE TO FUND PLANNED

00:01:15.042 --> 00:01:16.744
PARENTHOOD.

00:01:15.443 --> 00:01:18.679
WE DON'T BUILD THE WALL, BUT WE

00:01:16.878 --> 00:01:20.748
PUT MONEY IN FOR A TUNNEL.

00:01:18.813 --> 00:01:21.682
WHEN THE PRESIDENT WAS

00:01:20.882 --> 00:01:24.752
CAMPAIGNING, HE WASN'T

00:01:21.816 --> 00:01:26.154
CAMPAIGNING FOR A TUNNEL BETWEEN

00:01:24.886 --> 00:01:28.055
NEW JERSEY AND NEW YORK.

00:01:26.287 --> 00:01:28.356
IT WAS FOR A SOUTHERN BORDER

00:01:28.189 --> 00:01:29.490
WALL.

00:01:28.489 --> 00:01:31.459
WE'RE STILL GOING THROUGH THIS.

00:01:29.624 --> 00:01:32.693
BUT I'M NOT VERY OPTIMISTIC

00:01:31.592 --> 00:01:33.461
THERE WILL BE CONSERVATIVE WINS

00:01:32.827 --> 00:01:35.463
IN THIS.

00:01:33.594 --> 00:01:37.565
&gt;&gt; CONGRESSMAN MURPHY, IF I'M A

00:01:35.596 --> 00:01:39.300
DEMOCRAT AND I SEE THE HOUSE IS

00:01:37.698 --> 00:01:40.468
IN REPUBLICAN HANDS, THE

00:01:39.433 --> 00:01:42.837
SENATE'S IN REPUBLICAN HANDS, WE

00:01:40.601 --> 00:01:43.538
HAVE A REPUBLICAN, A

00:01:42.970 --> 00:01:44.739
CONSERVATIVE REPUBLICAN LIKE

00:01:43.671 --> 00:01:47.308
DONALD TRUMP IN THE WHITE HOUSE,

00:01:44.872 --> 00:01:49.677
AND I SEE PLANNED PARENTHOOD

00:01:47.441 --> 00:01:52.613
FUNDED, SANCTUARY CITIES FUNDED,

00:01:49.811 --> 00:01:53.781
CHUCK SCHUMER GETS HIS MEGA

00:01:52.747 --> 00:01:58.085
TUNNEL, NEW JERSEY-NEW YORK, AND

00:01:53.915 --> 00:01:59.420
A BUNCH OF OTHER STUFF GETS

00:01:58.219 --> 00:02:00.721
FUNDED, THERE'S NOT A BUNCH TO

00:01:59.554 --> 00:02:01.689
GET EXCITED ABOUT.

00:02:00.855 --> 00:02:03.324
YOUR REACTION?

00:02:01.823 --> 00:02:05.827
&gt;&gt; I THINK THE PRESIDENT IS

00:02:03.457 --> 00:02:06.227
SUPPORTIVE ON A LOT OF SHARED

00:02:05.960 --> 00:02:07.862
PRIORITIES.

00:02:06.360 --> 00:02:08.996
IT FUNDS MILITARY AND DOMESTIC

00:02:07.995 --> 00:02:10.698
PROGRAMS, ADDITIONAL FUNDING FOR

00:02:09.130 --> 00:02:11.499
THE OPIOID CRISIS WHICH IS

00:02:10.832 --> 00:02:13.968
RAVAGING OUR DISTRICT.

00:02:11.632 --> 00:02:15.870
AND THEN IT HELPS TO INCREASE

00:02:14.101 --> 00:02:17.238
FUNDING FOR NIH AS WELL AS

00:02:16.003 --> 00:02:18.239
MAKING SURE OUR VETERANS ARE

00:02:17.371 --> 00:02:19.941
TAKEN CARE OF.

00:02:18.372 --> 00:02:23.277
I HAVEN'T READ THE WHOLE BILL,

00:02:20.074 --> 00:02:23.678
AS MARK MENTIONED, BUT I'M

00:02:23.411 --> 00:02:25.012
OPTIMISTIC.

00:02:23.811 --> 00:02:26.647
I'M HOPEFUL THAT WE CAN COME TO

00:02:25.146 --> 00:02:27.982
A COMPROMISE BY TOMORROW.

00:02:26.781 --> 00:02:29.884
&gt;&gt; Laura: NOW, YOU HAVEN'T READ

00:02:28.115 --> 00:02:31.519
THE BILL AND I'M NOT CRITICIZING

00:02:30.017 --> 00:02:34.722
YOU BECAUSE THERE'S NO ONE --

00:02:31.652 --> 00:02:36.057
THE EVELYN WOOD A-PLUS CITATION

00:02:34.856 --> 00:02:36.457
STUDENT COULDN'T READ THIS BILL,

00:02:36.190 --> 00:02:38.125
OKAY?

00:02:36.591 --> 00:02:39.227
I'M NOT CRITICIZING YOU, BECAUSE

00:02:38.259 --> 00:02:41.329
YOU JUST GOT THIS.

00:02:39.360 --> 00:02:44.432
BUT GIVEN WHAT WE KNOW ABOUT OUR

00:02:41.462 --> 00:02:46.767
CURRENT DEBT LEVELS, IT'S

00:02:44.565 --> 00:02:48.870
EXPLODING, EXPLODED UNDER

00:02:46.901 --> 00:02:51.606
PRESIDENT OBAMA, EXPLODED UNDER

00:02:49.003 --> 00:02:53.441
BUSH, NOW IT'S SET TO INCREASE,

00:02:51.739 --> 00:02:57.445
COULD BE ANOTHER $1 TRILLION,

00:02:53.574 --> 00:02:57.745
MARK, TELL ME IF I'M WRONG ABOUT

00:02:57.578 --> 00:02:59.080
THIS.

00:02:57.879 --> 00:03:01.048
DON'T WE HAVE A MORAL OBLIGATION

00:02:59.213 --> 00:03:02.950
TO BE HONEST WITH THE AMERICAN

00:03:01.182 --> 00:03:05.253
PUBLIC ABOUT WHERE WE'RE GETTING

00:03:03.084 --> 00:03:07.755
THE MONEY TO FUND ALL THESE

00:03:05.386 --> 00:03:11.158
IMPORTANT PRIORITIES, CHINA,

00:03:07.889 --> 00:03:12.159
JAPAN, GERMANY, ALL THE PEOPLE

00:03:11.292 --> 00:03:13.861
WE'RE BORROWING IT FROM?

00:03:12.293 --> 00:03:15.363
WE DON'T HAVE THIS MONEY, DO WE?

00:03:13.995 --> 00:03:18.165
&gt;&gt; NO, WE DON'T.

00:03:15.496 --> 00:03:18.699
LAURA, HERE'S ONE OF THE

00:03:18.299 --> 00:03:20.301
INTERESTING THINGS.

00:03:18.833 --> 00:03:21.602
YES, WE'LL END UP WITH A $1

00:03:20.434 --> 00:03:22.536
TRILLION DEFICIT THAT WILL

00:03:21.736 --> 00:03:24.639
PROBABLY COME OUT IN OCTOBER OF

00:03:22.670 --> 00:03:25.706
THIS YEAR, $1 TRILLION-PLUS.

00:03:24.772 --> 00:03:26.974
HERE'S THE OTHER INTERESTING

00:03:25.840 --> 00:03:27.808
THING, YOU DON'T HAVE TO READ

00:03:27.108 --> 00:03:29.510
THE FINE PRINT TO UNDERSTAND

00:03:27.942 --> 00:03:31.846
THAT WE'RE GOING TO GROW THE

00:03:29.644 --> 00:03:32.113
SIZE OF GOVERNMENT BY 12% TO

00:03:31.979 --> 00:03:33.748
13%.

00:03:32.246 --> 00:03:36.284
WHEN YOU'RE LOOKING AT THAT KIND

00:03:33.881 --> 00:03:38.486
OF GROWTH, I DON'T KNOW THAT HIS

00:03:36.417 --> 00:03:40.521
DISTRICT OR MY DISTRICT, ANYBODY

00:03:38.619 --> 00:03:41.822
BACK HOME SAW A 13% INCREASE IN

00:03:40.655 --> 00:03:42.890
THEIR WAGES BUT SOMEHOW WE'RE

00:03:41.956 --> 00:03:43.691
GOING TO GIVE GOVERNMENT A RAISE

00:03:43.024 --> 00:03:45.293
LIKE THAT?

00:03:43.824 --> 00:03:45.826
HERE'S THE OTHER PROBLEM, LAURA,

00:03:45.426 --> 00:03:47.461
IS THIS.

00:03:45.960 --> 00:03:47.762
WE HAVE A REPUBLICAN-CONTROLLED

00:03:47.595 --> 00:03:49.563
HOUSE.

00:03:47.895 --> 00:03:49.897
WE HAVE A REPUBLICAN-CONTROLLED

00:03:49.697 --> 00:03:51.465
SENATE.

00:03:50.031 --> 00:03:51.966
AND WE HAVE A REPUBLICAN IN THE

00:03:51.599 --> 00:03:53.534
WHITE HOUSE.

00:03:52.099 --> 00:03:54.435
AND WE HAVE A DEMOCRAT HERE

00:03:53.668 --> 00:03:55.236
TONIGHT SAYING HOW GREAT THIS

00:03:54.568 --> 00:03:56.637
BILL IS.

00:03:55.369 --> 00:03:58.606
THERE IS A PROBLEM THERE WHEN

00:03:56.771 --> 00:04:01.475
YOU HAVE THAT.

00:03:58.739 --> 00:04:02.343
&gt;&gt; I THINK THE RIGHT HONORABLE

00:04:01.609 --> 00:04:04.078
GENTLEMAN FROM NORTH CAROLINA --

00:04:02.476 --> 00:04:05.179
&gt;&gt; Laura: HE'S SMILING.

00:04:04.211 --> 00:04:07.014
CONGRESSMAN, FIRST OF ALL, I

00:04:05.313 --> 00:04:08.082
ALREADY LIKE YOU, BECAUSE YOU

00:04:07.148 --> 00:04:10.117
CAME ON THE SHOW.

00:04:08.215 --> 00:04:11.819
A LOT OF YOUR COLLEAGUES WON'T.

00:04:10.251 --> 00:04:12.853
BUT I ALREADY LIKE YOU, BECAUSE

00:04:11.953 --> 00:04:14.522
YOU'RE BEING HONEST.

00:04:12.987 --> 00:04:14.956
THIS IS A GOOD BILL FOR

00:04:14.655 --> 00:04:16.757
DEMOCRATS.

00:04:15.089 --> 00:04:19.226
IT'S GOOD THE MILITARY GETS TONS

00:04:16.891 --> 00:04:20.328
OF FUNDING AND THAT'S ALL GREAT.

00:04:19.360 --> 00:04:20.861
MILITARY NEEDS A RAISE, I

00:04:20.461 --> 00:04:23.064
UNDERSTAND THAT.

00:04:20.995 --> 00:04:25.266
BUT YOU'RE SMILING, NOT JUST

00:04:23.197 --> 00:04:26.834
BECAUSE YOU'RE HANGING OUT WITH

00:04:25.399 --> 00:04:28.202
US ON WHATEVER THE HECK THIS IS,

00:04:26.968 --> 00:04:28.469
A WEDNESDAY NIGHT, YOU'RE HAVING

00:04:28.336 --> 00:04:29.904
FUN.

00:04:28.602 --> 00:04:30.905
THIS IS A GOOD DEAL GOR

00:04:30.037 --> 00:04:33.441
DEMOCRATS, I'M SORRY.

00:04:31.038 --> 00:04:36.077
&gt;&gt; HOW CAN YOU NOT SMILE WHEN

00:04:33.574 --> 00:04:37.044
YOU'RE STANDING NEXT TO

00:04:36.210 --> 00:04:38.346
CONGRESSMAN MEADOWS.

00:04:37.178 --> 00:04:39.947
LOOK, I HAVEN'T READ THE FULL

00:04:38.479 --> 00:04:41.615
BILL, I HAVEN'T MADE MY FINAL

00:04:40.081 --> 00:04:43.517
DECISION ON THIS, BUT IF IT'S

00:04:41.749 --> 00:04:45.186
FULLY FUNDING THE MILITARY

00:04:43.651 --> 00:04:49.590
PROGRAMS, RIGHT NOW OR MILITARY

00:04:45.319 --> 00:04:52.793
READINESS IS AT ALL-TIME LOWS.

00:04:49.724 --> 00:04:54.628
SECRETARY MATIS SAID WE CANNOT

00:04:52.927 --> 00:04:55.696
GOOD ON ANOTHER CONTINUING

00:04:54.762 --> 00:04:57.098
RESOLUTION STOP-GAP BUDGET.

00:04:55.830 --> 00:04:58.265
IT WOULD HURT THE MILITARY.

00:04:57.231 --> 00:05:00.134
&gt;&gt; Laura: MAYBE WE SHOULD THINK

00:04:58.399 --> 00:05:02.203
ABOUT THAT THE NEXT TIME WE

00:05:00.267 --> 00:05:03.971
COMMIT OUR TROOPS TO SOME

00:05:02.336 --> 00:05:05.339
GODFORSAKEN COUNTRY.

00:05:04.105 --> 00:05:07.375
MAYBE WE SHOULD THINK ABOUT WHAT

00:05:05.473 --> 00:05:10.244
IT WILL COST WHEN WE COMMIT OUR

00:05:07.508 --> 00:05:11.278
TROOPS TO ANOTHER MULTIPLE

